    usb: cdns3 fix use-after-free at workaround 2

    BUG: KFENCE: use-after-free read in __list_del_entry_valid+0x10/0xac

    cdns3_wa2_remove_old_request()
    {
            ...
            kfree(priv_req->request.buf);
